# An alternative cost is used whatever zone the spell is cast from (CR 118.9, 601.2b). Bot2's Duress takes Force of Will
# from Bot1's hand. On turn 3 Yawgmoth's Will (paid with Black Lotus) lets Bot1 cast it from the graveyard, and Bot1
# counters its own Mox Sapphire with it for 1 life and a Brainstorm exiled from its hand, paying no mana. The Mox is
# exiled and never enters.

