Bot2.Choose(Force of Will)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Yawgmoth's Will.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Graveyard.Force of Will.Cast(Mox Sapphire; Ability: exile a blue card)
Bot1.Choose(Pay 1 life)
Bot1.Choose(Brainstorm)
[T3 Bot1.End]

